    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμμος</span></b>  (A), or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμμος</span></b>  (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφ-αμμος</span>),
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
