				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.3.6
			</span></i>. (Related to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμαθος</span> as
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμμος</span> to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμαθος.</span>)</div>
